{"sections":[{"slug":"余端","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"余端"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">余端</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"余端"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">余端是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/端","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">端</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的对偶概念</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于函子</span> $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to \\mathsf{Set}$, $G\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$, <span lang=\"zh\">余端</span>\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in\\mathcal C} F(c) \\times G(c)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">可视为可测空间上的函数对测度积分的类比或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">被积函数</span>”, $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">测度</span>”.\n<span lang=\"zh\">这个余端也可理解为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代函子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $F\\colon 1\\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $G\\colon \\mathcal C\\to 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的复合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的张量积</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">当然</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这里的范畴也可以改成</span> $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">改成</span> $\\mathcal V$.)</p>\n<p>$G = \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> “delta <span lang=\"zh\">分布</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的类比</span>,\n$$\r\n\\int_{c\\in \\mathcal C} F(c) \\times \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,X) \\simeq F(X).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n"}]}}}]}